Oracle corpus (TestFindOracle): simple-markdown's answers for generated and
golden inputs. Generated offline by tools/discordref (see its README); CI never
runs node. Do not edit by hand.

simple-markdown: version <version>, commit <commit>, index.js sha256 <sha256>
generator seed: <seed>

One section per row:

  -- <id> --
  in <string>
  raw <link>      zero or more: simple-markdown's links (balanced mode)
  want <link>     zero or more: raw with Find's documented choices applied
                  (U1 balanced ')', the L1 label filter, the L2 kind rule)
  want same       instead of want lines: want equals raw

<string> and <link> are as in find.txtar. A row with neither raw nor want
lines expects no links.
